(Dio Cass. Ixxvii. lxxviii.; Herodian. iv.; Spartian. Vit. Caracall.;
      Aurel. Vict. Epit. xxi., Caes. xxi.; Eutrop. xxi.;
      Gruter, Corp. Inscr. pp. cxci. cclxvii. ccc. milxxxv.; Gibbon, chap. vi.;
